    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For native island endemics, compare phylogenetic distance to biotas of the nearest continent and other islands with distance to environmentally most similar remote regions. The claim is supported if nearest-source affinity predominates across clades and archipelagos.";
